# Data and planning apps

Five small apps handle records, forms, dates, tasks and files. They all have a **Share** tab with **Share & Chat**, and they all use the same three [layouts](#/layouts)!


::divider{wavy|Data and planning apps|cyan}
## Mainkey: records

!!#PR#Database# [Open Mainkey](/mainkey)

Build your own fields, then keep records in them. Search, filter and sort in a **Table**, or browse a **Gallery** with live statistics!

* **Home** has New Record, Add Field, the Table and Gallery views, and Sort By!
* **Data** imports and exports `.kb` files and exports `.csv`, and has Demo Data and Clear All!
* **Share** has a **Website Kit** and **Host**, which can serve the database straight from your browser tab so others can open it!

## Formly: forms

!!#PR#Forms# [Open Formly](/formly)

Build a form with **New Form** and **Add Field**, flip between **Builder** and **Preview**, and share it as a file:

* `.kfe` is an **editable** form, so the other person can change it!
* `.kfv` is a **viewable** form that people fill in!
* `.kfa` holds the **answers**!

Question text accepts Keydown, so chips and highlights work in forms. Share & Chat lets a group edit a form together!

## Hexa: calendar and boards

!!#G#Calendar# [Open Hexa](/hexa)

* **Calendar** shows months and an agenda for events. **Today** and **Year** jump around!
* **Boards** are columns of cards: **New Board**, **New Column** and **New Card**!
* **Import and export** standard `.ics` files (so you can swap with other calendars) and Hexa's own `.kh` files!

## Taskra: to-do lists

!!#C#Todo# [Open Taskra](/taskra)

Tasks have priorities and due dates. Filter with **All Tasks**, **Active**, **Done** and **Overdue**, and use **Clear Completed** to tidy up. Lists import and export as `.tk` files!

## Cabinet: drive

!!#R#Drive# [Open Cabinet](/cabinet)

Keep files in **drawers**, like a file explorer. **New Drawer**, **New Folder** and **Upload Files** are on the Home tab, and **Cards** or **List** views are in View. A whole drive downloads at once as a ZIP, and the Share tab can save a drawer as a `.kc` or `.zip` file!
